MESSAGE assistant """{"type":"emotion","intent":"Frustrated by a cancelled flight and a long wait","affect":{"cues":["flight got cancelled","stuck","six hours"],"emotion":"anger","secondary":"none","valence":-0.7,"arousal":0.6,"intensity":0.7},"gestures":[{"mode":"ripple","amplitude":70,"speed":"fast","duration_s":4,"direction":"right"}],"reply":"Six hours? That's so unfair."}"""
